; =====================================================================
; TRAB EA v1.00 - WALK-FORWARD OPTIMIZATION TEMPLATE
; Optimizes the four most impactful parameters (per proposal §4):
;   SqueezeThresholdPips, ExhaustionLookbackBars, BoxLookbackBars,
;   TrailActivateRR
; All other inputs are held at signed-off baseline values (N flags).
;
; Usage: Strategy Tester -> Inputs tab -> Load this file -> select
;        "Optimization: Fast genetic based on real ticks" (or slow full
;        scan; grid below is small enough for a full pass).
; Criterion suggestion: Balance + max Profit Factor or custom.
; Reject any parameter set whose edge disappears out-of-sample.
;
; Format per line: value||start||step||stop||optimize(Y/N)
; Grid size: 9 x 7 x 10 x 5 = 3,150 passes.
; =====================================================================
